  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Four charges&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;are placed on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Y</mi></math> plane at the points whose coordinates are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032816_Question_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 208px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rThe electric field due to these charges at a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, will be</p>\r",
    "image": null
